## Multiball Modes: {heading--multiballs}

### Deathclaw Multiballs: {heading--deathclaw}

Shoot the Deathclaw bash toy to advance towards starting the multiball. There are 3 different Deathclaw multiballs played in the same order every game. (*On the Premium / LE models, hitting the Deathclaw will fire the ball back at the player unless they aim at the designated weak point displayed using the lights below it.*)

During all Deathclaw multiballs, completing the Radroach targets scattered around the playfield will add a ball.

* **Deathclaw Multiball 1**: Hit lit shots for 20 seconds to build the Deathclaw value; then shoot the Deathclaw as many times as possible within 12 seconds to score jackpots and eventually score a super jackpot.
* **Deathclaw Multiball 2**: Charge the weapon by making switch hits and hitting shots. Once the weapon is charged, five shots will light for jackpots. Collect all 5 jackpots to light super jackpot.
